{
  "schema": "doc-card/v1",
  "code": "NL06.3",
  "chapter": "NL06",
  "title": "卷积定理（概率版）",
  "src": {
    "file": "notebook/math/survey/p6-prob.tex",
    "sha256": "sha256:64e47f763c4110757051d84ae9bab7a30da9592fe882cd1ef3ce0c5054ce7ca3"
  },
  "notebook_commit": "54390093a9c3e0ace557cb26a0a1e9f688d4a220",
  "notebook_dirty": true,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "NL06.3:body.s01",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "是什么",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "$X\\perp Y\\Rightarrow\\varphi_{X+Y}(t)=\\varphi_X(t)\\varphi_Y(t)$，等价于\n$p_{X+Y}=p_X*p_Y$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL06.3:body.s02",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "为什么需要",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "它是「独立随机变量求和」的唯一省力算法；也是 H3 在概率侧的同一条定理。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL06.3:body.s03",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "关键结论",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "成立条件：$X,Y$ 独立（不相关不够）；$\\varphi$ 存在（即分布有定义）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL06.3:body.s04",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "判据",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "与直接卷积对拍；离散情形用 H3 的循环卷积要注意补零（H4）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL06.3:body.s05",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "前置",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "P1、H3。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL06.3:body.s06",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "常见误解",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "以为「卷积定理说明两个和的分布等于两个密度相乘」。恰好**反了**：\n是**特征函数**相乘、**密度**卷积。"
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "kind": "library-know",
    "surveyId": "P3",
    "status": "框架：math/prob.hpp",
    "section": "概率：特征函数是「方向相反的那个傅里叶变换」"
  }
}
